WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.450
I'm Kurata Sana, first year
junior high school student!

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:39.950
My manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.450
My Aoki Award-winning Mama, and the squirrel, Maro-chan.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.960
My best friend that I met in
the bathroom, Fuka.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.880
The amazing white bat, Babbit!

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.080
My pose hasn't prepared.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:53.340
And best friend, Hayama Akito.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:22.950
Karate Club is A Good Place
Come For A Bit, Come to See!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.120
As you have seen just now,

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:30.960
since the mixture of ethyl and
water's boiling point has a big difference,

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.960
we will determine the different boiling points of the substances.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:38.930
I know! I laughed so hard at
Sana-chan in yesterday's 'Kodocha'. Dunn.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:39.880
I didn't.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.300
What? Akito-kun,
you didn't watch Kodocha?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.510
I don't watch it.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:48.430
So you just did your training and ran one time around the neighborhood.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.310
It was so funny!
Wasn't it, Aya-chan?

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.900
Uh-huh, you would have thought
yesterday's episode was funny, too.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:59.450
It was the "Experience the Sports" series, Challenging Chinese Martial Arts.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.410
Sana-chan punched and kicked
Zenjiro-san...

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:04.740
in an armor!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.870
Wow!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.410
Hayama-san, you don't mean you're
teaching Kurata karate?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.170
You, you're more awkward than before.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.170
Why would I...

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.630
Over there, are you listening to
the lesson, Hayama?

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.090
I'm sorry.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:21.130
If you don't have the nerves to
listen to the lesson, then get out of here!

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.930
- I do.
- Leave!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.770
Akito-kun, sorry...

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.730
Now, I will give out the solution
for the experiment...

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.030
Hayama left the classroom again...

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.950
Boring, I'm going home.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.960
Come to the teacher's room at lunch!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.040
At lunch time!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.800
Don't play innocent!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.840
Its not like I'm playing innocent.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:03.470
We heard a rumor that a student
named Hayama in Jinbo Middle School...

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:07.220
...used violence towards a student from another school...

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:11.180
You're the only Hayama
in our school!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.640
I didn't...

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.020
Ah...

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.690
What was that "Ah"?

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.570
It wasn't like that.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.530
Hayama, you'd better stop
underestimating your teacher.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.110
Is that a fact, Hayama-kun?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.320
I did not hit him.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.580
Ah, you didn't?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.620
Kyoto-sensei, Hayama is
learning karate now!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.420
Is there a school rule that bans us
from learning karate?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.090
It's a different story for a
student who keeps on having problems.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.010
"I did not hit him"?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.430
So you're confessing that you
threatened him with force?

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.810
Anyway, why did you start karate,

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:52.520
is it to make weak people obedient to you?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:56.770
Really, it's the kind of thing
that you would think about, Hayama.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.440
Good morning, everybody!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.650
K... Kurata?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.940
Kyoto-sensei! I'm in first year,
Class 8, Kurata Sana!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.030
What is it?

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.620
Kurata, are you going to defend
Hayama with our flimsy lies?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.280
Kyoto-sensei.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.580
Hayama doesn't have a
social life and can be naughty sometimes...

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:17.080
...but whether it's a high-schooler or the president for a Bengali or Hirokuba...

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.420
he'll admit if he did it!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.300
But that Hayama says that he did
not hit anyone.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.420
I can't trust that!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.180
You say that, but you're teacher?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.130
What?

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:30.180
This story is only a rumor, right?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.850
A teacher suspecting a student because of a rumor, what do you say about that?

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.230
I would like to believe Hayama's words.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.230
The principal even says not to
judge the students with prejudice.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.320
Suzuki-sensei that kind of
a thing...

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:49.990
Well, I will notify the principal
about the rumor when he gets back.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.540
And Hayama-kun, from now on,
please be careful of your own acts...

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.580
- Kyoto-sensei.
- May I return to class?

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.580
Well then, we'll be going now!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.630
Hayama...

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.590
That man, he really wants me
to get expelled.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:06.010
What...? Maybe the guy wants me to
skip school?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.010
He hates me.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:13.220
Oh well, teachers are humans, too.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.180
Hayama, you've changed...

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.480
In the past, you would have changed
your face at once.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.060
Whether it was a teacher or not,
you would've just attacked!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.480
My face was like that?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.740
And now, you can say those
kind of words.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.530
You grew up, you grew up,
I'm impressed, I'm impressed.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.570
Well, everyone has their likes and
dislikes!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.410
I mean, there are people who like
carrots and celery,

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.700
but get pissed off when
they see Kurata Sana.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.460
If you become a celebrity,
in exchange for getting fans,

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.250
there are people who hate you
and you've never even met them before.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.010
- I hate Kurata Sana...
- Yeah, you get that kind of a mail...

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.550
...and get attacked suddenly...

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.590
...and get a crack on your back.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.550
Really, in a sense, I'm weak.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.310
That kind of stuff happens?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.310
It happens, young master.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:01.190
But you know, if you get irritated
and hurt every time it happens,

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.480
there no limit to it.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.860
So if Sengoku-sensei pisses you
off with his little remarks, come to me.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.440
I'll tell you how to relieve
your trouble.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.160
Well. I'll never be convinced though.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.120
Sengoku-sensei,
he's aiming for your karate.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:19.290
Yeah, even if I trip and hit someone,
he'll probably say that I abused karate.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:25.290
Is there any way to stop Sengoku-sensei trying to find faults in your karate?

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.590
- Hey, are you listening?
- Yes.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.760
Sana really knows how to handle Akito.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.970
Akito's heart has never open to others.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.060
Sana is like mail, she can go in
and out of Akito's tangled mind.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.310
Akito has to be happy to have
a good partner.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.770
Yeah, I know.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.110
I've warned you not to call in
the midnight.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.610
What?!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.610
When I think you're taking notes so enthusiastically, it's this.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:54.870
Oh yeah! Sana, can you come to the
Gymnatics District Competition?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.410
The gymnastics team?

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.410
Ok, you are actually on
the Gymastics team, right?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.210
It's the last competition for
the first year,

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:05.040
I think you should at least go
rather than sit around doing nothing.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:07.840
That's it!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.800
What is it?

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.010
Fuka, thank you!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.970
Looks like she came up with
something...

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.180
The Karate team?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:20.350
Let the Jinbo Middle School know
how cool amusing and dandy the Karate is

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:25.400
...and add more friends and win
the district competitions and the Olympics!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:30.070
Then, Sengoku-sensei can't say to
you something stupid like stop karate.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.320
You're the one who's saying
the stupid stuff.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.030
Hayama! Wait!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.330
Anything wrong?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.290
How to make a club?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.000
How could I start the Karate Club?

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.460
Well, first you have to gather
members.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.340
If you find 5 or more people who
want to join in

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.420
then I could talk about it in
the next faculty meeting.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.340
Thank you, Suzuki-sensei!
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:02.140
But making another club means
that you need a teacher-advisor...

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.140
...but my hands are full with the
Swim Team and the Astronomy Club...

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.730
I don't know which teacher could help the Karate Club...

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.360
I don't have any idea right now.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.030
Actually I haven't any idea
at present.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.110
So I have to gather 5 people?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.410
Yes, you must do that first.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.870
Ok! We have to gather the members!

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:26.620
To capture a middle-school student
who wants to do karate alive nowadays,

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.710
it's not an easy task.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.170
Well, ask for mom's help!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.170
Well, I got an idea...

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.010
I guess we must do it in the
orthodox way, to attack them with gifts!

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:40.680
Join the Karate Club, you'll win
the free trip to Mediterranean by oil tanker.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.140
Yes, I'll join.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.600
I'll join too.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.850
Ok, two members arranged now!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:49.310
Mama, Onda-san and Shimura-san
aren't students from Jinbo Middle School, and...

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.520
they have no money, so NO.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:55.240
Sensei, you know you can't use
that way to solicit for a club.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.240
So that's useless... then we'll use the sex appeal strategy.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.910
Where is the sex appealing
a Karate Team?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:04.660
Oh, isn't a man beautiful in
a karate uniform?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.960
That's it!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.000
Use your stylish karate stance to
win girls' hearts,

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.920
the end of the century will be
ruled by karate. Let's go, Sana!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.630
- Sagami, paper!
- Yes, Sensei!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.800
- Onda, ink!
- Yes, Sensei!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.760
Now if she can only do that with
her regular occupation...

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.260
Let's make tea.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.270
More busy it is, more like to do
other things!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.230
Will you join the Karate Club?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.190
Me, karate?

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.600
That's impossible, Akito-kun.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.570
Your sharpness is for Karate.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.480
No! If you get hurt in karate,
it will be horrible,

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.110
and it's not suited for
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.280
I understand.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.780
Sugita, I don't care if it's you...

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.200
- Aya-chan?
- Show mercy!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.950
Sorry, Akito-kun, if that's God's
will, I'll certainly do Aya-chan's part.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.210
He must be thinking
"It's not like I'll eat you".

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:50.670
It's okay.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:51.630
Hayama!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.460
Sana-chan!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.460
Good morning, everybody!
Hayama!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.760
Yesterday night,
Mama helped me make signs.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.090
Rei-kun, what a shame.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:10.270
Hey, if you hand those out with
that scary look, no one will take them.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.520
Alright, there you go.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.020
Well, that's right,

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.190
flashing a smile, really good.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.440
Really?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.620
Will you join the Karate Club?

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.830
Will you...

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.580
We're looking for Karate Club
members...

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.630
Please!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.800
Are you really making a Karate club?

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.260
Hey, you,

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.340
would you join the Karate club?

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:47.060
...the end of the century will be
ruled by karate...

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.020
Please.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.390
I'll think about it.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:12:03.410
{parte b}

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:16.130
Babbilele Gang's ukulele show

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:12.870
Nowadays children are so knowing about fashion.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:16.460
They choose their perfect skirts

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.630
but their pants are inside out.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:26.510
That's mine, that's nice, isn't that life's...

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.930
Isn't that life's Ukelele.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.770
Everyone is so slow!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.520
I know it was gonna be like this.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.820
At least one person could have come...

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.990
Who was that person with the bushy
eyebrows and bleeding nose?

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.200
Who are you?

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.200
- My name's Ishida!
- I haven't seen you for a while, Ishida-kun.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.090
Ishida-kun, you'll actually join
the Karate club for us?

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.420
Yeah.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.300
Yay, thank you, Ishida-kun!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:04.130
The one thing we need is a person
with a bloody nose!

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.720
I don't understand that.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.720
Yeah... and...

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.390
You're stuttering, bloody nose.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:15.100
I'm not too good with barbaric stuff...

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.900
so I thought that I could appear
as Sana's manager assistant...

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.780
so that I don't need to train karate.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.190
Manager assistant?

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.610
What, you moron?

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.610
Well, a member is a member.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.580
Ok, my note, my note...

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.370
You aim for Kurata?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.580
You like her, don't you?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.330
Ok, so please sign your name,
grade and class here.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.670
Ok.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.460
Hey, count me and there's only three people?

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.170
Yeah, one member and two managers.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.090
We'll keep on asking people to join.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.930
If five people can't be gathered
then it's over.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.930
So we need two more people.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.850
Thanks... Ah, Ishida-kun?

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.310
Hey, join the Karate club!
Wait... don't run away!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:00.150
Excuse me,
is the Karate club here?

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.520
You mean the Karate club?

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.480
Are you here to join?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:06.200
Yeah, because I got this.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.990
Come in!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:12.080
Ah, I don't know who you are
but thanks!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:15.000
Sana-chan is happy. Sana-chan's
happiness is my happiness.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.620
Oh, I'm so happy.
Come and sign here.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.380
She seems happier than when
I joined.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.920
- Here you are!
- Thank you.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.510
I was so happy when Hayama-kun
asked me to join.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:28.970
Me?

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.970
Yeah, in the hallway in front of
the bulletin board.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.770
I see... Um...
What class are you in?

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.480
Huh? He's in the same class as
you, Hayama.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.780
Isn't it bad that you don't
know your own classmates, Hayama?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.070
Nakao-kun, any experience with karate?

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.280
None.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.910
Only one person left...

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.250
Oh oh, sorry.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.750
So much time passed and you guys
still didn't clean up so today's finished.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.000
Don't you want a clubroom?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.710
Well, we're still not a club yet.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:07.510
Hey you, won't you join the Karate club?
Hey, you don't have to run away!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.800
I'll ask Suzuki-sensei if there's
any rooms left.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.220
Ah, maybe that place is good!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.220
Where? Where?

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.190
Oh, the North building.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.940
This is the first time I've ever
been here.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.520
- Yeah.
- Me too.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:29.030
It used to be the industrial tech
room but now they're using the new building.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:32.160
I come here to get erasers and chalk

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.910
so often that I know this place.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.990
Wow, he's such a dull child.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.710
Hey, everyone!
I called Suzuki-sensei.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.710
I got permission for the Kyoto-sensei, for one week only.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.670
Yah!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.300
Isn't that great, Hayama?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.800
- Yah.
- Let's go, Nakao-kun!

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.680
Here?

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.100
Ooh, how nostalgic.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.810
Narrow, smelly, dirty.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.730
Nobody uses it so I thought this
would be good.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:12.030
Isn't there any place bigger
than this?

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:16.280
I think a 100 feet wide classroom with
a chandelier is enough...

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.620
Well, this building will be
demolished soon so...

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.410
just stand it before we have our
league's formal classroom.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:26.880
Well, they say that if you live in it,
it could turn into Lake BLAW. It's alright.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:30.050
Located in the center of the Shiga
prefecture,

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.720
Lake BLWA is made of many
dislocations of cave-ins.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:40.020
Length 68 Km and the widest 22 Km, being Japan's biggest lake...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.100
Wait, this doesn't have to do with anything.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:46.520
But there are some teachers who
are against the Karate club.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.440
The teacher against,
is it Sengoku-sensei?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:56.160
Anyway until it is formally
approved of, refrain from big actions.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.830
- Sensei!
- I'm alright!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.950
Be careful not to get hurt.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:03.370
I know you guys won't stand still.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.420
Kurata, I'll leave you with the
door lock.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.540
Yes, Sensei.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.540
- Bye.
- Thank you very much!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.800
If many men apologize together,
you'd say 'Thanks a lot'.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:15.340
Are you making up an sentence now?
Then I'll say thank you very much!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.510
That's corny.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:20.220
If you live in it, it could be a city.
Let's work together as managers.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.930
Hey, you didn't you give up on
Sana-chan?

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:25.890
In order to work hard
we need one more person.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.690
Excuse me...

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.320
Sengoku-sensei is against karate?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.480
Looks like it.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.320
- Why?
- I don't know.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.150
But we can't stay here and do nothing.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.160
So let's not waste time and
do some stretching.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.120
You're right!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.870
Since I'm the manager,
the two of you work hard.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:43.830
Stretching.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.170
One more person...

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.710
Um... Sana-chan.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:55.720
The rumor that you broke up
with Naozumi-kun, is it true?

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.800
So you're single now?

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.640
Great!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:02.060
Ok! Standing still won't do
anything.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.600
Can you go out with me, Ishida-kun?

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.730
What?! Going out with Sana-chan!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:11.650
Starting now, I will do the training that I usually do, so keep up with me.

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.900
This is kind of like your physical test.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.610
Physical test...

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:17.490
First we'll lightly do 30 laps.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.910
That's not light.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.950
Going out... is this?

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:26.620
Those who don't have any after school activities, why don't you join the karate club?!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.210
Are you tired?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.880
No, it's fine.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.130
Alright.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.440
Huh? That's Sana-chan.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.020
Wow, Fuka.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.730
What happened... Oh... bushy
eyebrows, long eyelashes...

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:57.650
- I'm Ishida!
- You have a hard time.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.780
Oh, yeah.
That's a weird combination, Sana.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:03.280
Are you interested in going to
the district competition?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.700
This is my life's wish, please
join the Karate club, Fuka.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.000
Moron! Who are you kidding? No!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.920
The karate club doesn't have
enough people in it?

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.300
Yeah, if it's like this then it
won't be approved of as an after school activity.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.880
Sana, you really have no greed or
common sense when it comes to Akito.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.260
Well... excuse us a minute, Sana.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.050
What's wrong, Fuka?

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:29.770
Sana, a while ago I heard Sengoku-sensei and Suzuki-sensei talking to each other.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:34.310
Suzuki-sensei, if you're being so
lenient like that, you'll regret later.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.780
Because in the end, we're the ones
who are gonna be held responsible.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.990
I can't think of it that way.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.820
Making a Karate club,
that's not a joke.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:47.290
If we keep on approving Hayama's selfishness, we can't have anymore of his victims.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.450
Sengoku-sensei...

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.250
Those people, if we put on a sweet
face, they will run wild.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.960
What we need is the power
to control them.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:59.590
Seems Sengoku-sensei
won't approve of Karate.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.840
If you don't care and
make little wrong now,

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:04.720
Akito will really get it.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:05.930
I know.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.180
You know?

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.270
That's why I wanted to make the
Karate club.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:12.850
Not just for Hayama,
but for myself too.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.020
I'm not used to the formal and
serious spectacle.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:26.240
Really the first three months is just
wiping the floors and sitting on your legs

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.950
and it's really boring.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.160
Oh, really?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.620
Ok, try that.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:36.710
Alright, we're done for today.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:39.170
Thank you very much.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.420
This guy, he's not a girl, right.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:42.550
Finished...

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.470
Hey, can we have a toast to
raise the mood?

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.220
Yeah, sounds good!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.810
- Um, I... I can't...
- You can't?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.390
Sorry, next time I'll be okay.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:54.640
Well, see you.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.520
Bye, see you tomorrow.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.270
See you tomorrow, Nakao-kun!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:05.700
Tighten your arms, grip your fist
and as if you're drilling it in...

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.030
Don't get hurt!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:12.160
This anime really has a lot of
eating and going out.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:17.540
Today thank you for being here for
Sana while you guys are busy.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.710
Why is it for you?

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:25.180
To be frankly, it's me, Sana-chan's
birthday of 13 years old.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.550
Oh, congratulations!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:32.310
Sana is singing

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.930
March 7th is Sana-chan's birthday.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.850
The day when Mama found me.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.940
March 7, March 7.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.230
Somebody said that

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:42.030
there's a newborn baby next door. A lovely baby!

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.280
So mom named this for me!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.150
March 7th., Sana Sana Sana...

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.240
Sana Sana Sana Sana Sana... Kurata Sana

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.700
March 7th., Kurata Sana...

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.660
But this has nothing to do with the story.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.920
Wow, Sana-chan! Congratulations,
congratulations!

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:01.880
- I'm, home.
- Brother, let me borrow it too.

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:04.170
Let me borrow it!
Let me borrow it!

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.260
Dinner is ready.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.300
What? Curry again?
I wanna eat ramen.

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:10.510
Well then tomorrow.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:14.390
Ramen, ramen!

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:25.240
For the bright future of Jinbo
Junior High School's Karate Club!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.860
The first and last Karate Club.

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.410
Anyway... for the bright future!

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:31.370
Cheers!

